{
  "info": {
    "name": "Academy — Lessons & Flex (Phase 2)",
    "_postman_id": "academy-lessons-flex-v1",
    "description": "Lesson lifecycle + Flex engine built in local_academy (Phase 2).\n\nStories: US-LS-1-1 (request) · US-LS-2-1/2-2/2-3 (negotiate) · US-LS-3-1..3-4 (start/complete/absence) · US-LS-4-1/4-2 (cancel) · US-LS-5-1/5-2 (time update) · US-TR-1-2 / US-ST-2-2 (view) · US-FN-1-2 (reserve) / US-FN-1-3 (return).\n\nHOW TO RUN:\n1. Auth → Login as Student / Teacher / Admin (each saves its token).\n2. Setup → Purchase Flex package (the student needs an active package with Flex before requesting).\n3. Request & Negotiation → Request a lesson (saves {{lessonid}}), then accept/suggest/reject.\n4. Lifecycle / Cancellation / Time update / Views.\n\nEndpoint: {{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php (action chosen by the `function` param). Every state-changing call is POST; reads are GET. The token identifies the acting user.\n\nA collection pre-request script auto-sets {{future_time}} (now +2d) and {{future_time2}} (now +3d) so requested/suggested times are always valid.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "var now = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('future_time', now + 2 * 86400);",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('future_time2', now + 3 * 86400);"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8081", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "student_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "teacher_token", "value": "ea6d941746294c7b034d5d1ed5dbd385", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin_token", "value": "f65e3a453f23cdf4f550dedc23fc2c31", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "teacherid", "value": "16", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "packageid", "value": "6", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "lessonid", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "future_time", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "future_time2", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login as Student",
          "event": [
